    the number of Otoshidamashi Counters on this card. Each Token''s Level is increased
    when Summoned by the number of Otoshidamashi Counters on this card, also each
    Token''s ATK/DEF are its Level when Summoned x 500. You can only use this effect
    of "Otoshidamashi" once per turn.'
